/* The upsert route film: its own look, loaded after the kit's. Everything here starts
   with ur-. The frame is 1280 by 720 and the camera never moves, so a CSS size is the
   size on screen. Nothing that means something is under 22px (PLAN.md, rule 2).
   Colors carry who: blue Marc-Antoine, purple Michael, dashed grey nobody on record,
   amber the stamp and the open places, red only what the code returns as an error. */

:root {
  --ur-ink: #1f2733;
  --ur-edge: #2a3344;
  --ur-sub: #565f70;
  --ur-line: #cfd6e1;
  --ur-soft: #eef1f5;
  --ur-grey: #8791a3;
  --ur-amber: #8a5a00;
